+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: parity-block recovery followed by GF(2) Gaussian elimination is "
+        "O(n^3) bit operations; the measured shipping-preset cost is reported by "
+        "selftest under reference_algorithm, while the compact peel-and-propagate "
+        "route uses at most 240 XORs at n=120."
