+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: parity-block recovery followed by GF(2) Gaussian elimination is "
+        "O(n^3) bit operations; at shipping n=96 it took a median 65,222 counted "
+        "bit operations and 0.000804 seconds over the eight G6 seeds, while the compact "
+        "peel-and-propagate route uses 192 XORs."
+    ),
